  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Transparency Intl 2007-09 - Transparency Intl 2007-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisationsst&#xF6;d till Transparency Intl 2007-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1 Verksamhetsst&#xF6;d till Transparency International (TI) som &#xE4;r en ledande akt&#xF6;r inom korruptionsfr&#xE5;gor. Sidast&#xF6;d sedan 1990-talet. TI &#xE4;r en NGO och en r&#xF6;relse med ca 100 frist&#xE5;ende nationella kapitel som arbetar mot korruption p&#xE5; nationell niv&#xE5;. Detta st&#xF6;d &#xE4;r riktat till TI&apos;s globala och regionala arbete och g&#xE5;r till TI&apos;s internationella sekretariat i Berlin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Transparency International (TI) International Secretariat in Berlin for its anti-corruption work globally and regionally. TI is a leading actor in anti-corruption. TI is a NGO and a movement consisting of around 100 independent national chapters combating corruption on national levels. Sida support since 1990ies.</narrative>
  </description>
